#Linux
Baʼii barreessi: (Ajaja ls -la), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: (Daandii /home gabor Desktop), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: (Daandii /root: ['my\\ documents'], business presentations), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: ((Ajaja ls: ['my\\ documents']) > ['list.txt']), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: ((Ajaja do: ['this'], fi: ['that'])), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: ((Daandii go: ['here'], fi: ['there'])), dhaabi.